        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Birch Sextant banking trojan sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01532. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Birch Sextant Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01532)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Birch Sextant Banking Trojan: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Birch Sextant banking trojan in campaign PTF-01532.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"e38ef38921aecc70720ed8373a44e9747f4a7a7637b04942d3d6559771a241b6\", \"85103a27422f62bbbc7ef4927fe7e95e6f5af55b210a292cee7128ea7af566e4\", \"55173181bdbfcdb4f1ded31720bee11dd34f361feb0f38ae838aefd2c57e5ab2\", \"beb27f69b1eb00a83caec52bc03874c2fb45610754979cb83686e4917dcf7e65\", \"babb428e281e337147dcc454701be847e4042b03ad41c3f4299c1b81ab96cc25\", \"0250842f7366c776385145143c7790defda971f8ddd619dee5c5ea783b241873\", \"c8bd48ea827367b59ec3df8dfc00fcae0986cf170a48a965b672e3c59fe27af4\", \"ada83f37a360aef2122a914280d18d1d489e3e72f0b78734ae1b0102e2699d09\", \"a44c5445ee991a9c7c8089416386af2c8ce48575e5464c0a3ed19e3cac251301\", \"d41cb119fe741183d55ad8e7a9bd852bfcf0dfdb2ac3c7714fe01e2c7a4715f6\")",
